# Parity audit: Command (2026-11-12)

Reference: `spec/components/command/contract.md` + `contract.json` (status draft, 0.1.0).
Audited: `src/components/command/*` (8 elements, `context.ts`, `Command.scss`, stories), `playwright/tests/command/command.behavior.spec.ts` (34 tests listed), decision SB-0103.
Method: read-only comparison of contract against code; `npm run check` run (read-only). Tests were not re-run by this audit.

